      "widgets_values": [
        "Save Media + Output Name\n\n1. Load Image Sequence: paste the plate folder. Its 'name' output names the outputs ({name} in Output Name).\n2. Output Name: folder, file name, version (next free / fixed / off) and date folder \u2013 the only place for names.\n3. Check the names before rendering: select Output Name, right-click > Queue Selected Output Nodes. The names appear on the node; only the loader and Output Name run, nothing is rendered or written.\n4. Put your processing between the loader and Save Media (images / mask), then queue as usual.\n\nSeveral Save Media (e.g. one for the comp, one for the matte) can share one Output Name: same name, same version.\nNew version of a loaded render next to it (not inside it): drag the loader's 'folder_root' onto Output Name's output_folder."
